    "sections": {
        "description": "The Optical Store theme is tailored for eye care businesses, eyewear products, and vision services. It features well-structured layouts for showcasing products, detailing services, scheduling appointments, and displaying testimonials and contact information. With a responsive design, the website operates seamlessly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customizable options allow users to modify colors, typography, banners, and page layouts while ensuring a professional and clean look. Additionally, the theme includes image galleries, blog sections, and dedicated areas for showcasing eyeglasses, lenses, and optical accessories. Ideal for an optician shop, optics store, eye clinic, or eyewear retailer, this layout effectively organizes information about eye doctor consultations, optometrist services, glasses collections, and health-focused vision care solutions in an accessible online store format."
    },
